---
// About.astro - Static component for the about section
---

<section id="about">
	<div class="about-content">
		<h1>Samuel Gonzalez</h1>
		<p class="identity">B.S. Computer Science · Georgia Tech</p>
		<p class="intro">
			I enjoy competitive, high-pressure problem-solving, whether that means building software or competitive PC gaming.
			I center my work around professionalism, collaboration, and enterprise satisfaction.
		</p>
	</div>
</section>

<style>
	#about {
		background: transparent;
		padding-top: clamp(4.5rem, 10vw, 8rem);
		padding-bottom: clamp(4.5rem, 9vw, 7rem);
	}

	.about-content {
		max-width: 780px;
	}

	#about h1 {
		font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3.15rem);
		font-weight: 650;
		letter-spacing: -0.035em;
		margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
	}

	.identity {
		color: #b9d6c5;
		font-size: 1rem;
		font-weight: 600;
		margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
	}

	.intro {
		font-size: 1.05rem;
		line-height: 1.7;
		color: var(--text-light);
		margin-bottom: 0;
	}

</style>
